{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02911","headline":"酬贺遂亮 · 韩思彦","name":"酬贺遂亮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人一言重，尝谓百年轻。\n今投欢会面，顾盼尽平生。\n簪裾非所托，琴酒冀相倂。\n累日同游处，通宵欵素诚。\n霜飘知柳脆，雪冒觉松贞。\n愿言何所道，幸得岁寒名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩思彦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}